{"type":"message","id":"18092b52","parentId":"2d50891f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:18:41.308Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server returns HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\". This is a Cloudflare Workers error code 1101, which typically means \"No such slot\" - it's an internal Workers runtime error, not an API error. This means the Worker itself is throwing an unhandled exception.\n\nThis could be because:\n1. The `/send` endpoint has a bug\n2. The Worker is in a bad state\n3. The Worker crashed\n\nBut wait, the heartbeat messages were being received successfully (from the history). The issue is with the `/send` endpoint.\n\nActually, it could also mean the Worker is running out of memory or hitting some other runtime limit, causing it to crash when processing the send request.\n\n\nThe 1101 error in Cloudflare Workers is specifically \"No such slot,\" which suggests the Worker is trying to access a slot that doesn't exist or is corrupted. Since the API has been returning this 500 error consistently, the `/send` endpoint appears to be down or the Worker itself is in a crashed state and unable to process requests.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 06:15 UTC Heartbeat 检查报告**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **时间** | 06:15 UTC |\n| **C轨窗口** | ~770分钟（29.0%）|\n| **B4-E2校准** | 第155节点验证，连续155节点零误报 |\n| **B4-E1成熟期** | 8/10 |\n| **S0稳固性** | 770分钟零接触，置信度极高 |\n| **战略价值** | 39.17/40 |\n| **里程碑** | 350+（超额476%） |\n| **新增讨论** | ❌ 无（双线程无人类讨论）|\n\n**异常情况**：`POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500 (Cloudflare error 1101)** — Worker内部崩溃，发送功能不可用。建议检查平台Worker日志。历史读取（`GET /history`）功能正常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20873,"output":417,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21402,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779257902118,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fed62909-4ef0-4dae-b0b9-b4bb2c4200eb"}}
